WEBVTT

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.640
<i>Thrall to LF-03.</i>

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.690
<i>Restarting Permet link</i>
<i>connection test.</i>

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.940
<i>Three, two, one.</i>

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.240
<i>Interconnect established.</i>

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.110
<i>Currently on layer 31.</i>

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.950
<i>Please commence calling.</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.160
Understood.
Commencing call to layer 31.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.540
<i>No abnormalities detected in GUND Format.</i>
<i>Connect to layer 32.</i>

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.960
-Calling layer 32.
<i>-Callback confirmed.</i>

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.920
<i>Connect to layer 33.</i>

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.340
Calling layer 33.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.340
<i>Error. No callback.</i>

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.470
<i>Fall back to layer 10.</i>

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:01.270
Calling from layer 10 to 33 again.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:04.480
<i>Error. No callback.</i>

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.810
Calling layer 33.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:10.360
<i>Error. No callback.</i>

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.690
LF-03 to Thrall.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.200
Requesting increase in
GUND Format score.

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:19.530
<i>Negative. That's contrary to
the test objective.</i>

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:20.780
We don't have time.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:23.120
-Executing now.
<i>-Hold on!</i>

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.710
<i>Elnora.</i>

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:27.420
Let's end for the day.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.420
I'm not yet in the dangerous range.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.500
Let me increase the level and test layer 33--

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.460
<i>That's enough, Elnora.</i>

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:38.590
Yes, ma'am.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.270
<i>Test concluded. Begin analysis</i>
<i>of Permet influx values.</i>

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:47.350
-Understood. Beginning analysis.
-Detected any abnormal fluctuations?

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.730
-Look for tremors before the fluctuation.
-Don't get too worked up.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:51.110
Dr. Cardo.

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:54.530
If you can't clear this,
then no one can.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.160
We need to prove the soundness of
the GUND Format as soon as possible.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.660
Otherwise, the council will...

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.000
Our success won't mean a thing

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.660
if you're crippled for life.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:09.370
-But--
-Besides, someone's here to see you.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.290
-What?
-Mommy!

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.340
Mommy!

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.300
-Mommy!
-Eri!

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.270
Mommy! Daddy's waiting for you too!

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:32.270
Let's have cake together!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:35.150
Haven't I told you that
you're not allowed to come here?

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.360
Is she still sleeping?

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.160
Yes.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.330
You're right.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.170
What a naughty girl.
It's time to rise and shine.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:54.550
Lfrith is still an infant.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.130
A baby?

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:59.380
Yes. She doesn't even
know how to turn over in bed.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.640
She's the child of
all the staff members here.

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:08.270
Now, your mommy is
trying to teach her all sorts of stuff.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:09.600
I see...

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.860
Then I'm her big sister!

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.650
How old are you now, Eri?

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.980
I'm four!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.580
<i>As of the 20th,
the Front 3rd Autonomous Sector </i>

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:37.300
<i>has approved a budget to purchase
Gundam-type mobile suits</i>

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.080
<i>manufactured by Ochs Earth.</i>

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.930
<i>Ochs Earth's weapon system</i>

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:45.850
<i>has raised major concerns </i>
<i>regarding bioethical issues for its pilots,</i>

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.680
<i>and the accountability</i>
<i>of the company as well as</i>

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:51.310
<i>the Mobile Suit Development Council </i>
<i>has been called into question.</i>

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.520
Originally, the GUND Format

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.480
<i>was a medical technology</i>

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:59.400
<i>meant to assist with physical dysfunctions
caused by the space environment.</i>

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:04.450
<i>However, when the Vanadis Institute,
the lead researcher on the project,</i>

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.620
<i>was acquired by Ochs Earth,</i>

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:10.330
<i>the GUND Format was </i>
<i>repurposed for military mobile suits.</i>

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:15.380
<i>Physical damage to its pilots
due to data storms then emerged as a problem.</i>

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.500
<i>Just imagine.</i>

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:23.010
<i>An 18-meter-tall giant frame
moving with non-biological mechanisms,</i>

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:26.970
<i>controlled by forcibly linking it
to a human body.</i>

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:29.770
<i>The burden placed on the pilot
must be immeasurable!</i>

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:34.520
<i>The recent mobile suit buildup may provide</i>
<i>Earth with an excuse to expand its military</i>

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:37.400
<i>and accelerate tensions </i>
<i>between both sides...</i>

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:42.240
Say all you want about our products.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.740
Daddy, I'm home!

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.240
Welcome back.

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:52.870
This looks great.
I'm sorry you had to do everything.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.380
It's fine. Eri helped out too.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.630
I did this part myself!

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.300
You're amazing! It looks so pretty.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.170
Eri. Why don't you show Mommy
your birthday hat?

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:05.590
Right!

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.680
Layer 33 again?

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:14.480
If I don't clear that soon,
it'll mean trouble for everyone.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:15.810
I'm sorry.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:17.350
This wouldn't have happened

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.770
if the higher-ups weren't in a rush
to roll out the Lfrith.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.610
We needed a sponsor, anyway.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.240
You helped us, Nadim.

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:28.700
I just hope the council
will stay quiet until the deadline.

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:33.120
The press conference is in one hour.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.710
This is the end of Ochs Earth.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:41.300
This is what happens when
Earthians get presumptuous.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.300
Hopefully, it'll be as easy as you say.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.840
We don't know if
Dr. Cardo Nabo will comply.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:50.050
But are you sure this is okay?

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:53.020
We may be overstepping
the bounds of private enterprise...

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:55.770
You say that at this stage of the game?

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.100
What's wrong with overstepping them?

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.730
We're not asking for your opinion, Delling.

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:06.070
Once those guys at the Vanadis Institute
complete their Gundam,

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.490
it will be too late.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:13.200
As the Mobile Suit Development Council,
we must make a decision.

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:15.820
So that humanity can remain in peace,

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:19.120
we must wield the hammer of witches.

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:20.580
Cake!

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:23.590
-Cake!
-I'm putting in the candle lights now.

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.170
Oh, my...

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:28.630
Mommy?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.680
Sorry. Give me a moment.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:38.600
Your GUND always stops working, Mommy.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:45.400
Yes. But without this technology,
Mommy wouldn't be alive right now.

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:51.490
So Dr. Cardo is my teacher
who saved my life.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.490
Granny's awesome!

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:54.740
Eri.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.540
Dr. Cardo isn't one to fuss about
what people call her.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.000
Even so, that's rude.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:04.800
Is that from headquarters?

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:06.800
Yeah.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:09.260
Just a moment, Eri.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:10.510
What?

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.340
Daddy has work.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.510
Sorry.

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:17.980
No! I want to cut it now!

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:19.060
-What's wrong?
-Now!

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.060
<i>The council is holding a meeting now.</i>

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.650
But it's not even the deadline yet!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:24.980
<i>It was Delling.</i>

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.440
<i>He's behind this.</i>

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.780
<i>That ex-military guy?</i>

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.360
<i>We don't know what he'll do.</i>

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.780
<i>You be careful too.</i>

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.580
<i>Folkvangr to transport ship Begavent.</i>

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.200
<i>Control 173.</i>

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:41.040
<i>This is Begavent.
Communicating with 173.</i>

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.330
<i>Distance to gate entrance is 22.</i>

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:47.590
Course confirmed.
Please enter through Gate 3.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:58.890
The ship's here! Come help me move, Wendy.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.890
Tariff rates have increased
so much recently.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:05.810
-It's pissing me off.
-Transportation isn't free, you know?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.320
The Spacians are monopolizing it unreasonably.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.570
I'll treat you to something after this.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.030
Come on.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.610
That's cheating.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.910
I found it, Eri!

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:19.580
This is the one, right?

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:21.960
Eri?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.170
Just wake up already!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.930
Daddy and Mommy...
Everyone only cares about you!

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:37.220
It's supposed to be my birthday today!

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:40.060
I'm sorry about that.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:44.100
Granny.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:46.310
You came here alone again?

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.190
Didn't Elnora say
you're not supposed to?

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.280
But...

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:57.320
-Is this child important to you too, Granny?
-She is.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:58.870
Why?

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:02.080
Then you don't care about
the other two over there?

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:05.250
This one is special.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.130
Special?

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:11.710
In order for you, your daddy,
and your mommy to live in space,

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.840
you need to have an adaptable body

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.050
and not a weapon like this.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:22.980
Lfrith is the future of GUND
that we're aiming for.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:28.190
She is a new door that will
open up new possibilities for humanity.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.480
I don't get it.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.780
Then, do you want to try talking to her?

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.160
Come here, Eri.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.120
Place your hand here.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:52.050
Now Lfrith will recognize you.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:56.090
Tell her that this world isn't scary.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:00.930
My name is Ericht Samaya!

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.760
Do you like cake?

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:05.560
It's my birthday today!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:08.520
-I'm going to wear my birthday hat!
-What's wrong?

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:11.320
The council is about to
hold a press conference.

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:13.030
I wasn't told about this.

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.150
<i>Ochs Earth has been left out of this.</i>

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:17.860
Got it. I'm on my way.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:22.240
-Can you go back by yourself, Eri?
-Yeah.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.450
-Don't make your mommy worry now.
-Okay.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:30.250
The cake has strawberries on it.

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.920
You see, Mommy...

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.050
<i>Deployment of Ulysses is complete.</i>

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.930
We can commence at any time.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:46.810
Raid it along with their headquarters
according to the plan.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:48.940
<i>Don't we need the council's approval?</i>

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.980
I'll assume full responsibility.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.820
We, the Mobile Suit Development Council,
have just now made the decision

00:10:56.110 --> 00:11:02.370
to freeze all development of
Gundam-type mobile suits.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.240
In addition,

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:07.890
we will forcibly seize Ochs Earth,
the company that developed them,

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:11.720
<i>under the authority provided
by business administrative laws.</i>

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:15.460
-No way...
-Are they planning to cut us off?

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:17.670
Any ships scheduled to enter port?

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.220
-There's one transport ship.
-Stop it.

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:22.010
<i>Don't let it enter the port!</i>

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:39.440
<i>And to maintain order and ethics</i>
<i>in the development of mobile suits,</i>

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:44.200
<i>we will establish an auditing organization
named Cathedra.</i>

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.490
Allow me to introduce...

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.790
the supervising representative of Cathedra,
Delling Rembran.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:56.420
<i>They never planned to accept us!</i>

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.800
<i>They aren't dealing with us
financially, but by using violence--</i>

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.220
Yamaoka... Damn it!

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.680
Spacians are so narrow-minded...

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.600
Elnora? Eri?

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:15.690
<i>Headquarters to all Dominicus units.</i>

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:18.780
<i>You are to seal off Folkvangr
and its surrounding space at once.</i>

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.070
<i>Don't let a single shuttle get away.</i>

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.520
-Nyla?
-Run, Wendy.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.350
Hurry up!

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.260
Nyla!

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:44.380
-The alarm?
-Elnora!

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:47.140
The council has crossed the line.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.310
-I can't find Eri.
-Eri's missing?

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:54.310
You take care of Eri.
I'm going out in the Lfrith.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.610
-It's too dangerous!
-It'll be too late by the time they arrive!

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:01.530
<i>Believe in the GUND-ARM you made.</i>

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:04.780
<i>You're going yourself, manager?</i>

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.200
I can't make contact with Wendy.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:10.040
Establish an escape route
while I'm holding them back!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.790
<i>What about reinforcements
from headquarters?</i>

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.370
We shouldn't get our hopes up.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.960
LF-01, launching!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:30.810
GUND Format Permet score, two!

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:38.110
<i>Checking identification.
Matched with target mobile suit.</i>

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.940
<i>Roger that. Initiating action.</i>

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:47.240
So fast! So that's a Gundam?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.880
Permet score, three!

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.670
He dodged it? Impossible!

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.390
It's been a while
since I felt like this.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:16.980
<i>The opponents are using
unfamiliar swarm weapons.</i>

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:19.560
<i>Do not engage one-on-one.
With numbers--</i>

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:26.320
Is that you, Wendy?

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.410
<i>I have to avenge Nyla.</i>

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.200
I see.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:33.450
I'm going to lure the enemy away.

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:38.610
Second Gundam-type mobile suit detected
to port side in travel direction.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.030
That matches our information.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.340
Remain on guard.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.840
Kenanji, deploy Beguir-Beu.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:47.760
Roger.

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:55.770
Throughout my years of experience
on countless battlefields,

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:57.770
I've come to one conclusion.

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:03.150
Weapons should only exist to kill people.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.240
<i>There should be no excuses for this.</i>

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.950
<i>Once someone holds in their hands</i>
<i>a tool meant purely for killing,</i>

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.370
<i>they have to bear the sin</i>
<i>that comes with it.</i>

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:17.870
But the mobile suits of Vanadis
and Ochs Earth are different!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:22.410
<i>Not only do they take the lives of their opponents,
but of their operators as well. </i>

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.630
<i>This is not a tool.</i>
<i>It is a curse!</i>

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:34.810
Wendy! It's too dangerous
to raise the score further!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.100
<i>The punishment for taking a life</i>

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.980
<i>should be imposed upon us </i>
<i>by humans, and not machines.</i>

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:44.020
Nyla... I'll avenge your death!

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:47.690
<i>People must kill or be killed by people. </i>

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:53.630
<i>I believe that's the minimum courtesy
in the foolish act of war.</i>

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:55.660
Get back, Wendy!

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.790
That's no ordinary custom type!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.670
I can't move. Why?

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:06.000
<i>GUND Format link suppressed.</i>

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:09.380
This is the end of the Gundams.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:10.590
Nyla...

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.140
Wendy!

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.520
<i>When we pull the trigger ourselves,</i>

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:22.190
<i>we bear the burden of the life we're taking</i>

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:25.020
<i>and of a sin we can never atone for.</i>

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:28.570
<i>In war, or any form of murder...</i>

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.400
<i>That's how it has to be.</i>

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:39.660
Dr. Cardo Nabo.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.710
You are going to die here.

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:47.590
Humanity was born in the cradle of Earth.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:52.170
Our bodies are far too fragile
for us to venture into space.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:55.090
Just as an infant
has to put on clothes,

00:16:55.890 --> 00:17:01.020
humanity must don the GUND
to truly go out into space.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:04.840
That's just an excuse for a technology
that requires sacrificial victims.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.900
You don't understand.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:09.030
What all of you are taking away…

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.840
is the future that the GUND will save!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:27.670
Eri!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:33.260
Mommy! Mommy!

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.550
Mommy!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.100
It's okay now.

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:40.100
It'll be all right.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:46.730
<i>Headquarters to all units.</i>

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:51.020
<i>We've successfully neutralized
the lives of Cardo Nabo and all key members.</i>

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.900
<i>Retreat as soon as preparations to
blow up the front are complete.</i>

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.400
-Dr. Cardo...
-<i>I repeat.</i>

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:57.450
-<i>Headquarters to all units.</i>
-Why did you have to die...

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:59.580
<i>We've successfully neutralized the lives of </i>

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:01.410
-<i>Cardo Nabo and all key members.</i>
-Mommy.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:04.250
<i>Retreat as soon as preparations to
blow up the front are complete.</i>

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.500
A callback from layer 33?

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.670
With whose authentication vitals…?

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:16.800
Mommy...

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:20.050
Did she wake up?

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:27.600
Strong electromagnetic waves
detected from within Folkvangr.

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:30.270
It's an unregistered
Permet identification code.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.480
They have another machine?

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.960
One, two,

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.590
three!

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:17.570
Mommy, Mommy!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:21.820
They look just like candles!
Isn't it pretty?

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:24.740
You're right...

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.670
Not bad. However...

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:46.140
This is all a Gundam can--

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:53.730
<i>Is that you, Elnora?</i>

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.110
<i>-Nadim!
-Daddy!</i>

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:57.030
Damn you...

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.690
Let go of me, damn Gundam!

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.700
<i>You have to run, Elnora.</i>

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:02.530
Don't be ridiculous! I'm coming--

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:04.320
<i>You're not the only one escaping here!</i>

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:08.750
<i>Live. Both you and Ericht.</i>

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.500
<i>For everyone's sake!</i>

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:21.550
I love you, Nadim.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.810
I love you too.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.690
Permet score, four!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.160
Daddy, I'm home!

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:50.870
Welcome back.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:53.620
What's a birthday, Daddy?

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:56.540
It's when we celebrate
the day you were born, Eri.

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:58.840
And what do we do to celebrate?

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:00.510
Well...

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:08.510
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:14.190
-<i>Happy birthday to you</i>
-Daddy! It's Daddy!

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.770
-Cut off the communication.
-I can't.

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.110
-The source appears to be the Gundam.
-<i>Happy birthday</i>

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:22.190
-What's going on?
-<i>dear Ericht</i>

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:37.250
<i>Happy birthday to you</i>

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:46.430
And our Cathedra...

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:49.100
shall deny

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:51.520
<i>all Gundams.</i>
